<title>UK: World rubber stocks litle changed in March - IRSG.</title>
<headline>World rubber stocks litle changed in March - IRSG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>World stocks of rubber were little changed during March, 1997, according to latest International Rubber Study Group (IRSG) statistics.</p>
<p>    Data in thousand tonnes --  MAR'97   FEB'97   MAR'96</p>
<p>Natural production		  520	500	480</p>
<p>Natural consumption		 520	520	510</p>
<p>Natural stocks		    1,850    1,850    1,650</p>
<p>Synthetic production		830	810	820</p>
<p>Synthetic consumption	     840	820	840</p>
<p>Synthetic stocks		  2,390    2,400    2,370</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
